### ============================================
### Auction API - Requests (Task 4: Security)
### Student: 1bac24020
### ============================================

### 1. Security (Basic Auth)
### 1.1. No login - 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### 1.2. Login admin (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123

### 1.3. Login alice (USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic alice:password123

### 2. Registration
### 2.1. Register new user - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "newuser", "email": "newuser@example.com", "password": "password123"}

### 2.2. Register short password - 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "baduser", "email": "bad@example.com", "password": "123"}

### 2.3. Register existing username - 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "alice", "email": "alice2@example.com", "password": "password123"}

### 3. CRUD (require auth)
### 3.1. Get all users (ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123

### 3.2. Get all users (USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic alice:password123

### 3.3. Create user as ADMIN - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "created_by_admin", "email": "byadmin@example.com", "password": "123456", "role": "USER"}

### 3.4. Create user as USER - 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic alice:password123
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "should_fail", "email": "fail@example.com", "password": "123456"}

### 3.5. Create lot as ADMIN - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auction-lots
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemId": 1, "startPrice": 500, "bidStep": 50}

### 3.6. Create bid as USER - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bids
Authorization: Basic alice:password123
Content-Type: application/json

{"lotId": 7, "userId": 4, "amount": 600}

### 4. Business operations
### 4.1. Close lot as ADMIN - 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/business/lots/7/close
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123

### 4.2. Close lot as USER - 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/business/lots/7/close
Authorization: Basic alice:password123

### 4.3. Pay deal as ADMIN - 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/business/deals/1/pay
Authorization: Basic admin:admin123

### 5. Public endpoints
### 5.1. Get CSRF token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf

### 5.2. Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "public_user", "email": "public@example.com", "password": "password123"}

